; soak.script [SECS n]: the virtiorng soak on the Kickstart build with two
; cards: one torture run over both units at once (8 tasks, alternating
; units; a reset of each card every 1.5 s), two rounds of SECS seconds
; each (default 900: 30 minutes in all).
;   Execute SHARED:rbench/soak.script [SECS 900]
.key SECS/K
.def SECS 900
FailAt 30
Copy SHARED:rbench/rngread RAM: QUIET
Protect RAM:rngread +rwed QUIET
RAM:rngread TORTURE <SECS> 0 8 2 >RAM:r-soak.txt
Copy RAM:r-soak.txt SHARED:rbench/out/ QUIET
Type RAM:r-soak.txt
